3 REM 5000 ROUNDS OF A=A+SQR(I)*1.5/3+SIN(I/100). NO HISTORICAL PEER: IT
4 REM MEASURES THIS MACHINE'S MATH UNIT, WHICH DOES EHBASIC'S FLOAT
5 REM ARITHMETIC AND SQR/SIN IN HARDWARE. BEFORE THE MATH UNIT: 4.03 S.
10 REM FLOAT BENCHMARK: 5000 ITERATIONS OF + * / SQR SIN
20 T=PEEK(54541)+256*PEEK(54542)
30 A=0
40 FOR I=1 TO 5000
50 A=A+SQR(I)*1.5/3+SIN(I/100)
60 NEXT
70 T=PEEK(54541)+256*PEEK(54542)-T
80 IF T<0 THEN T=T+65536
90 PRINT "A =";A
100 PRINT "TIME:";T;"FRAMES =";INT(T/0.6)/100;"SECONDS"
900 PRINT: PRINT "ANY KEY...";
905 GET K$: IF K$="" THEN 905
910 IF PEEK(1039) THEN LOAD "BENCH.BAS"
